{:edb/db-before-t 266 :edb/db-after-t 267 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533579 50 #inst "2026-10-11T10:18:48.430Z" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186119777 1038 #edb/ref 17592186409688 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186119850 1038 #edb/ref 17592186409690 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186119851 1038 #edb/ref 17592186409689 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186119851 1038 #edb/ref 17592186409691 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186120431 1068 #edb/ref 17592186118700 13194139533579 17592186045417 false] [17592186120431 1068 #edb/ref 17592186409687 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186120431 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186120431 1071 "Suppose $A$ is a $4 \\cdot 4$ matrix and $det(A) = 12$. The matrix $B$ is obtained from $A$ by applying the elementary row operations $R_{2}↔R_{3}$ and $R_{1}:=R_{1} + 2R_{3}$. What is the value of $det(B)$?" 13194139533579 17592186045417 false] [17592186120431 1071 "Suppose $A$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix and $det(A)=12.$ The matrix $B$ is obtained from $A$ by applying the elementary row operations ${R}_{2}↔{R}_{3}$ and ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+2{R}_{3}.$ What is the value of $det(B)?$" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186120431 1074 "First, let's figure out what each operation does to the determinant.\n\n- The operation ${R}_{2}↔{R}_{3}$ involves swapping two rows, so it changes the sign of the determinant to the opposite one.\n\n- The operation ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+2{R}_{3}$ involves adding a multiple of one row to another row,  so it does not change the determinant.\n\nTherefore, we only have to change the sign of the determinant to the opposite one. Consequently, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B) & =-det(A) \\\\  & =-(12) \\\\  & =-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1043 #edb/ref 17592186409692 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1043 #edb/ref 17592186409693 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1043 #edb/ref 17592186409694 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1043 #edb/ref 17592186409695 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1043 #edb/ref 17592186409696 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1045 "Row and Column Operations on Determinants" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1046 #edb/ref 17592186409694 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048462 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409657 1053 #uuid "26bcedbd-f502-5256-b322-6d751a0c036d" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409658 1080 "-256" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409658 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409658 1083 #uuid "08098a6b-f06b-51d7-be19-39ddeb566f21" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409659 1080 "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1}" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409659 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409659 1083 #uuid "3f5903e6-2dfb-5988-91aa-d76353ccd959" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409660 1080 "-7" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409660 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409660 1083 #uuid "403dcee3-3eac-5cf3-a329-0558750fb3b8" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409661 1080 "-24" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409661 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409661 1083 #uuid "4da115ec-321e-53f5-9c9a-06b3818508a4" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409662 1080 "6" 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409662 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533579 17592186045417 true] [17592186409662 1083 #uuid "4e01723b-cc89-5e3f-b933-6517b2094770" 131941